    "Erase it from Operations to rewrite the data area. Formatting won't help: it already has a Capability Container.": {
      "comment": "Scan result body under \"This tag's data won't read\". Names where Erase lives, because the scan sheet has no route to Operations, mirroring the sibling string for a tag with no Capability Container.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "امسحها من قائمة العمليات لإعادة كتابة منطقة البيانات. لن تفيد التهيئة: البطاقة تحمل Capability Container بالفعل."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bórrala desde Operaciones para reescribir el área de datos. Formatear no ayudará: ya tiene un Capability Container."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacez-le depuis Opérations pour réécrire la zone de données. Formater n'aidera pas : il a déjà un Capability Container."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "データ領域を書き直すには「操作」から消去してください。フォーマットしても解決しません。Capability Container はすでにあります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apague-a em Operações para regravar a área de dados. Formatar não vai ajudar: ela já tem um Capability Container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「操作」中擦除以重写数据区。格式化没有帮助：它已有 Capability Container。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
